 cars leave. pro","h04601-nov20-04-ai":"4 shreya is a web developer who creates webpages for a variety of different companies. (a) photographs on a webpage are usually compressed. (i) state which method of compression is most likely to be used for this purpose. [1] question answer mark guidance 4 (a) (i) lossy 1 ao2.1 (1)","h04601-nov20-04-aii":"(a) photographs on a webpage are usually compressed. 4 shreya is a web developer who creates webpages for a variety of different companies. (ii) explain the need to compress photographs in this situation. [2] (a) (ii) 1 mark per bullet up to a maximum of 2 marks, e.g.: 2 • reduces the size of the image file ao2.1 (2) • uses lower bandwidth in transmission • takes up less storage (on the http server)","h04601-nov20-04-b":"4 shreya is a web developer who creates webpages for a variety of different companies. (b) in order to view a website, a user enters a website address into their web browser such as http://www.ocr.org.uk. the website will then be displayed onto the user’s screen. explain how the domain name system (dns) plays a role in websites being loaded. [4] 4 (b) 1 mark per bullet up to a maximum of 4 marks 4 award the mark for checking of cache at any of the ao1.1 stages but limit to one mark for this aspect. • dns is used to resolve ip corresponding to url (2) • request sent to dns resolver. ao1.2 • resolver checks its cache and if it doesn’t hold (2) the url, it passes it in to the tld name server which checks its cache and returns the answer or passes on to the.. • authoritative name server. • the ip address is returned back up to the requesting client. • or an error if no resolution can be found.","h04601-nov20-04-c":"4 shreya is a web developer who creates webpages for a variety of different companies. (c) shreya has received a webpage written in html shown in fig. 2.1. <html> <head> <title>bbc computer</title> <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"bbc.css\"> </head> <body> <h1 id=\"beeb\">history of t